писи, находятся на моем (нашем) ответственном хранении.</p></td><td style="vertical-align:top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/bssPhr5135/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5135" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5135"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/dfass5x08t/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/bssPhr5136/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5136" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5136"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/dfasdynlol/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/bssPhr5137/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5137" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5137"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/dfasls2k8k/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/bssPhr5138/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5138" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5138"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/dfasf4ngv2/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/bssPhr5139/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5139" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5139"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/dfaseh44d3/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/bssPhr5140/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5140" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5140"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/dfas9qyg63/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="vertical-align:top; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8585/bssPhr5141/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5141" data-dwh-source-type-fa